      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiel%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Kiel was once known as the Wooden Shoes Capital of Wisconsin because it held the state's only wooden shoe factory.",
