      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiel%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Kiel Municipal Band dates back to the late 1800s and is known for its signature tune, Invincible Fidelity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
