      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiel%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "German immigrants founded Kiel in the mid-19th century, establishing a community shaped by agricultural growth and dairy farming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
